        "Content": "A town centre mixed-use building.\r\nComprising 2 x ground floor retail units with residential accommodation overhead and rear warhouse.\r\nExtending to approximately 530 sq. m (5,704 sq. ft) in total.\r\nLocated on the main street of Edenderry town centre.\r\n1 x ground floor retail unit tenanted. \r\nTotal current rent reserved 4,800.00 per annum with vacant possession of 1 x retail unit, First floor and rear warehouse. \r\n\r\nThe properties are arranged over ground and first to provide a town center mixed-use property. Internally the property comprises 2 x retail units on the ground floor, residential accommodation on the first floor, and a rear warehouse. The properties are located in Edenderry Town Centre. Surrounding occupiers include Spar, An Post and AIB Edenderry.  Total floor area extends to approximately 530 sq. m (5,704 sq. ft) in total.\r\n\r\nWe are informed that 1 x retail unit is subject to an informal tenancy at a current rent of 4,800 per annum."
